        "cap-tea-basement"
      ],
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d9",
      "topic": "通风",
      "choice": "南面两跨可开启洞口 + 东西侧窗 + 北墙高窗，形成穿堂风。",
      "rationale": "无空调的南方稻田气候需要自然通风，高窗避免遮挡柜台背墙。",
      "source": "agent",
      "requirementIds": ["req-tea-healthy-cross-ventilation", "req-tea-pavilion-south-view"],
      "notes": null
    },
    {
